### Enterprise Legal RAG Platform - Document Ingestion & Lifecycle API
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Upload Legal Agreement Document
# @name uploadDocument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_cloud_agreement.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Section 12.3 Termination for Convenience: Customer may terminate this Agreement or any active Service Order for convenience without cause at any time upon providing at least sixty (60) days prior written notice to Provider.
Section 15.1 Governing Law: This Agreement shall be governed exclusively by the laws of the State of Delaware.
--WebAppBoundary--

### Capture Document ID from upload response
@documentId = {{uploadDocument.response.body.document_id}}

### 2. Check Document Status & Ingestion Progress
# @name getDocumentStatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. List All Ingested Knowledge Base Documents
# @name listDocuments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?skip=0&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### 4. Explicit Trigger to Process / Ingest Existing Document Chunks
# @name processDocument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}/process
Accept: application/json

### 5. Document Validation Failure Scenario: Unsupported File Extension
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="malicious_payload.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

BinaryExecutableContent
--WebAppBoundary--

### 6. Delete Document & Purge from Vector Index
# @name deleteDocument
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Accept: application/json
